# 📈 Kaizen Wealth — Interactive Compound Interest & Goal Planner

**Kaizen Wealth** is a client-side web application designed to help users model long-term financial growth, calculate compound interest multipliers, and reverse-engineer savings goals. Built with modern, zero-dependency web technologies, it features real-time visualizations, customizable guide documentation, and local data persistence.

---

## ✨ Features

- **Interactive Wealth Accumulation Calculator:**
  - Real-time calculations with synchronized range sliders and numerical inputs.
  - Visual breakdown of **Total Principal Invested** vs. **Compound Interest Earned**.
  - Interactive multi-year growth chart powered by Chart.js.
  - Detailed year-by-year amortized schedule table with one-click **CSV Export**.

- **Reverse Goal Planner:**
  - Calculate exact required monthly or daily contributions needed to reach a target financial milestone.
  - Interactive target progress visualizer with dynamic celebratory feedback.

- **Editable Financial Guide & Multiplier Studio:**
  - In-depth guide explaining **Compound Multipliers**, **The Rule of 72**, **Real vs. Nominal Returns**, and **Dollar-Cost Averaging**.
  - **Live Content Editing Mode:** Modify guide text directly in the browser to add personalized notes or custom strategies.
  - Auto-saves custom guide modifications to `localStorage` with a one-click reset option.
  - **Compound Multiplier Matrix Tool:** Instant lookup table for growth multipliers across custom interest rates and timeframes.

- **Offline-First & Local Storage:**
  - Auto-saves inputs, preferences, and custom guide edits directly to the browser.
  - Print-optimized CSS rules for saving clean PDF reports.

---

## 🛠️ Built With

- **HTML5** & **Vanilla JavaScript** (ES6+)
- **Tailwind CSS** (via CDN for modern UI styling)
- **Chart.js** (for dynamic wealth projection graphs)
- **Lucide Icons** (for UI icon set)
- **Canvas-Confetti** (for goal completion animations)

